translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_06b7173d:

    # RANDOM_MAN "LOOK! IT’S THE PRINCESS!"
    RANDOM_MAN "看！是公主！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:371
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9988f46e:

    # "Nervously stepping out onto the balcony, the beautiful Princess Cecilia smiled and waved at the crowds timidly. Adored and loved by all, {i}the realm’s Princess{/i} was renowned for her charitable and kind nature."
    "美丽的塞西莉亚公主紧张地走上阳台，怯生生地向人群微笑挥手。这位{i}王国的公主{/i}深受所有人喜爱和爱戴，以其慈善和善良的天性而闻名。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:372
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_120bafa6:

    # "I don’t think there was a single hot-blooded male that hadn’t dreamed about her at some point or another, me and 马库斯 included."
    "我想没有一个热血男儿不曾梦想过她，我和马库斯也不例外。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:373
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_2eff982e:

    # "I must have had a thousand dreams where I climbed into her chambers through a window and we stole away together and—"
    "我一定做过上千个梦，梦见自己从窗户爬进她的寝宫，然后我们一起私奔，然后——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:379
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_9441240c:

    # "马库斯 reappeared from the crowd and playfully grabbed my shoulder, squeezing it tightly as he leaned over to speak in my ear."
    "马库斯从人群中再次出现，顽皮地抓住我的肩膀，紧紧捏着，俯身在我耳边说话。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:380
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_cd3b5f70:

    # MARKUS "So, when we get to the Royal Court, which one you chasing?"
    MARKUS "那么，等我们进了宫廷，你打算追哪个？"

