    ALCOTT "万岁！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:450
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_4834d82f:

    # CROWD "HEIL EMPEROR ALCOTT! HEIL THE NEW ALDERIAN EMPIRE!"
    CROWD "阿尔科特皇帝万岁！新奥尔德里安帝国万岁！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:451
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_debab30d:

    # ALCOTT "Go now and do your Emperor proud! Do your country proud and do yourselves proud!"
    ALCOTT "即刻启程，为你们的皇帝争光！为祖国争光，为自己争光！"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:456
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_bbe6fc24:

    # "And with that, Emperor Alcott descended from the podium, escorted back towards the fort from which he ruled and administered his government duties from."
    "说罢，阿尔科特皇帝走下讲台，在护卫下返回他统治并处理政务的堡垒。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:457
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_47d3e974:

    # "As he passed by me, he looked at me for a moment, with the coldest eyes I had ever seen, as though his gaze could cut through and freeze my very soul."
    "经过我身边时，他瞥了我一眼——那是我见过最冰冷的眼神，仿佛能刺穿并冻结我的灵魂。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:462
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_a8edd937:

    # ADARA @ talk "He’s so scary..."
    ADARA @ talk "他太可怕了..."

