    MARKUS "彼此彼此，祝你好运。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:482
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_052cae9b:

    # "Each of us headed over to over respective queues, where hundreds of students would now wait for hours to receive the letter that would decide their life."
    "我们各自走向队列，数百名学生将在此等待数小时，领取决定命运的文书。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpyDay:483
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_488e3fc8:

    # "Sometimes, the wait would leave some to not find out until the early hours of the next morning..."
    "有时等待漫长，有人直至次日凌晨才知晓结果..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:484
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_19e073a7:

    # "After five hours, I finally arrived at the stall."
    "五小时后，我终于抵达登记处。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:486
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_e7442a13:

    # "马库斯 had already come and gone half an hour before, after he’d managed to slip into the queue slightly ahead of me."
    "马克斯半小时前便已离开——他设法排到了我前面。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:487
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_386634eb:

    # "He’d promised to meet me afterwards outside his home, then we’d head out to celebrate together."
    "他承诺之后在家门外等我，然后一同庆祝。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:490
translate zh qst_Terminus_EnterPalace_dedd2831:

